    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677400/extras/ac7eae38a994020a6c3a47c1bccf9eee.avif?t=1747946429\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span>Welcome to Brix Infinite, where the timeless brick-breaker game enters the modern age! Harness the power of attention, sharpen your focus, and increase your precision with every brick you break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Endless Challenges, Limitless Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>37,660</strong> levels spread across 1185 dynamic themes, Brix Infinite offers a vast and engaging gameplay experience. Progress through the game by clearing all the bricks on each level to unlock new themes and exciting challenges. Stay motivated with an active leaderboard, where you can compete with others or push yourself to beat your personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Elevate Your Focus, One Brick at a Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brix Infinite isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s your personal focus companion, designed to help  with improved attention, dexterity, and cognitive skills. This isn\u2019t just about breaking bricks, it\u2019s about building better habits for concentration and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Seamless Play &amp; Pause, On Your Terms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life doesn\u2019t pause, and neither should your game. Need to take a call or reply to a message? No problem, pause anytime and resume right where you left off, seamlessly moving between desktop and mobile phone. Whether you\u2019re playing for a quick mental reset or an extended challenge, Brix Infinite adapts to your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Make It Your Own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your experience with a beautiful background, a family-friendly avatar and a custom nickname that reflects your style. Take control of your focus, sharpen your mind, and enjoy a safe, immersive gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Brix Infinite today and start breaking bricks\u2014one mindful move at a time.<br><br>READY, SET, BREAK!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677400/extras/ac7eae38a994020a6c3a47c1bccf9eee.avif?t=1747946429\" data-has-big width=800 height=374 /></span>Welcome to Brix Infinite, where the timeless brick-breaker game enters the modern age! Harness the power of attention, sharpen your focus, and increase your precision with every brick you break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Endless Challenges, Limitless Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>37,660</strong> levels spread across 1185 dynamic themes, Brix Infinite offers a vast and engaging gameplay experience. Progress through the game by clearing all the bricks on each level to unlock new themes and exciting challenges. Stay motivated with an active leaderboard, where you can compete with others or push yourself to beat your personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Elevate Your Focus, One Brick at a Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brix Infinite isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s your personal focus companion, designed to help  with improved attention, dexterity, and cognitive skills. This isn\u2019t just about breaking bricks, it\u2019s about building better habits for concentration and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Seamless Play &amp; Pause, On Your Terms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life doesn\u2019t pause, and neither should your game. Need to take a call or reply to a message? No problem, pause anytime and resume right where you left off, seamlessly moving between desktop and mobile phone. Whether you\u2019re playing for a quick mental reset or an extended challenge, Brix Infinite adapts to your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Make It Your Own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your experience with a beautiful background, a family-friendly avatar and a custom nickname that reflects your style. Take control of your focus, sharpen your mind, and enjoy a safe, immersive gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download Brix Infinite today and start breaking bricks\u2014one mindful move at a time.<br><br>READY, SET, BREAK!</p>",
